{
  "_README": [
    "One entry per subvertical. To add one:",
    "  1. drop its Shopify export at sources/<key>.json",
    "  2. copy a block below, edit brand/theme/collections",
    "  3. python3 build.py <key>",
    "Then commit. The site serves it at ?v=<key> and Insider fetches",
    "its feed at /feeds/<key>.xml.",
    "",
    "collections maps Shopify product_type -> the collection shown on site.",
    "Anything not listed is dropped (merch, gift cards, samples).",
    "subcats are keyword rules scoped per collection, first match wins."
  ],
